+<p><b>Has Beevers Reserve itself been demonstrated to meet Council’s own framework for a permanent public toilet?</b></p>
+<p>That includes whether the reserve fits the type of public space Council prioritises for toilet provision, and whether a facility here can meet the requirements for visibility, lighting, clear sightlines and natural surveillance without creating new blind spots or unreasonable impacts for surrounding homes.</p>
